# a global skill whose approval record has the approver twice
$ skills validate --source-root <WORLD>/skills
exit: 1
--- stdout ---
--- stderr ---
[APPROVAL_MALFORMED] alpha: skill "alpha": approval record <WORLD>/skills/alpha/.approval.json is malformed (parse approval record: duplicate JSON object key "approver"); fix or delete it, then run: labdrian skills approve --id alpha --approver <name>

